{
  "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang",
  "chapter": 4,
  "act": 4,
  "scene": "zhaoyang",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "tangjian",
    "shenheng",
    "songhuizhen",
    "xujinghe"
  ],
  "require": {
    "flag.enthroned": true
  },
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "兑现原案存毁，使照料权不依赖一人代签",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "原案留还是毁已经定下，你回昭阳殿看照料凭据的办法。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "次日帷幔已卷起，殿内残留熏香，门口的冷风吹不到案后。",
      "image": "e39_ch04_s04_l2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l3",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_keep_order": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原案存好了。封了哪号、谁能看、谁保管，都在这里。缺的字另记。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_keep_order": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "别在原字上悄悄补。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_burn_order": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "照你确认的清单，昨夜焚完，执行与在场人留名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_burn_order": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是依我昨夜说的办。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_burn_order": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "沈将辞牒搁在清点单上，印与差牌放在纸旁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_burn_order": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "经手的事交清了。我为什么辞署，也请留原话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_burn_order": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "照你的原话存。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_burn_order": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她等唐收清物件，离开了案边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l11",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "药送到了，人见着了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l12",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "见着了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l13",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这两种新办法，你和她……想怎么登记？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l14",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我说我的，她不在。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l15",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那先听你的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l16",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "第一种，两人都愿意便一起入册，谁照料谁、财产怎么管，逐项说定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l17",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两个人都得亲口答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l18",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一人没答，不能代填。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l19",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "第二种，不一起入册。各自写准许谁照料、代领或管财产，分项给凭据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l20",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "每件准许什么，都分开写。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l21",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她准了哪件，就只能替她办哪件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l22",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没准的，不能顺手也办了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l23",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不入籍，也能进病舍？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l24",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "给过照料凭据，查过就能进。不能再因为没一起入册而拦人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l25",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l26",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "给谁看呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l27",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "本人、照料的人和办这件事的人看。对外只公布办法，不列姓名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l28",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这张给我带回去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l29",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可以，带回去给她看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l30",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "想撤时，另一人——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l31",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不用求她准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l32",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l33",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "各自能收回自己准许的事。已经交的钱物，另算清。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l34",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "宋把空着第二个署名的纸折好，没有请你替她催。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l35",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一起入册，双方查过便少带几张凭据。分项给凭据，少问私事，却得多跑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s04_zhaoyang.l36",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把两份办法分开放好，等着落笔。"
    }
  ],
